WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.870
Thanks for calling Ace Roofing.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.530
I'm Liv, how can I help?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.560
Hi, we noticed a damp patch on the ceiling in one of the upstairs bedrooms

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.110
after the rain yesterday.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.280
It looks like it might be coming from the roof, but I was hoping someone could

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.340
come out and take a look and let me know how much it's going to cost and what

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.170
needs to be repaired.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.840
Is the damp patch an active leak with water currently coming in, or is it just

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.900
a stain from earlier?

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.950
And is the property residential and two -storey?

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.960
Well, I don't see any water coming out of it right now, although it might

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.130
slowly be dripping.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.290
And it's a two -storey residential building, sorry, we've got a loft as well.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:44.770
Thanks.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.040
Could you please provide the full address of the property where you'd like us

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.310
to inspect the roof?

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.940
Include street, city and zip code.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.000
Yeah,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.090
[Privacy redaction]

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.940
[Privacy redaction]

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.970
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.490
Got it.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.350
May I have your name and the best phone number to reach you on?

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.320
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.200
my telephone number

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:15.130
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:19.790
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.420
Would you prefer an inspection appointment in the morning or afternoon or any

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:24.910
time?

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:29.100
And when would you like us to come out tomorrow, later this week or another

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:29.380
day?

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.380
If you could come out tomorrow, that would be great.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.030
Tomorrow morning, maybe 9, 10 o 'clock, around about that time.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:44.700
We can have someone with you tomorrow at 9 in the morning, 9 .30 or 10 in the

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:45.150
morning.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.240
Which of those times works best for you?

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.210
9 o 'clock is great if you can come in.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.620
To confirm, that's 9 in the morning tomorrow

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.380
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:58.420 --> 00:01:59.900
[Privacy redaction]

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:01.310
[Privacy redaction]

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:03.000
The callback number

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.280
[Privacy redaction]

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:07.640
[Privacy redaction]

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:12.700
issue is a suspected slow drip leak causing dampness on the ceiling upstairs in

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.570
a two -story residential property.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:15.690
Is all of that correct?

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.930
Yeah, that's all correct.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.410
The inspection is booked for 9 in the morning tomorrow.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.640
The team has all your details and will be there to assess the suspected slow

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.410
